    <node id="Blood Tests">
      <data key="d0">Blood Tests</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">**Blood Tests** refer to a broad category of diagnostic laboratory evaluations performed on blood samples to assess overall patient health, evaluate organ function, analyze blood cell populations, and detect specific biological markers and disease indicators. These evaluations encompass a wide range of standard panels and specialized assessments, including complete blood counts (CBC), comprehensive metabolic panels (CMP), blood chemistry profiles, alkaline phosphatase (ALP), kidney and liver function tests (LFTs), hormone level evaluations, and tumor markers. 

Clinically, blood tests serve as vital tools across all stages of medical care, particularly in oncology and endocrine management. They are routinely utilized prior to, during, and after therapy to establish baseline health, guide and refine treatment plans, monitor therapeutic response, and check for disease progression or recurrence. Specifically, blood tests play essential roles in diagnosing, managing, and monitoring conditions such as acute myeloid leukemia (AML)—where they track cell and blast counts—chronic myeloid leukemia (CML), ovarian cancer, pancreatic cancer, and adrenal conditions, including detecting signs of hormone hypersecretion.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb36cedd3f66584d65304e58b668eeab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4da30dee72e228147daa825e4f5be72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-829d6b7840e9f2c8d97d22d2ce2c43c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f36a4a5be80c8fa51631db16e52b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27b3a0f53b4be1d525497f87555d7a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fb70c1c798caae12ac2d64e61bcbad4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82c7205fc2067a4d00e43fd22276db22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06038ec84f20e873b9e275a23aea8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29c9b8b5fd2cd967c48522af79a9598f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69e63736c94b8b08a565c3d8679d3b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7606b44d6a30ad0519bc4c10785de79a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6268b6efa690f6e094e443dca6b4cb52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1379433bc205cdec8af2edc77613acb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7102a43dfb62e649d725bc95ba292688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3ba7430f3a31330247f52afe7e9c68a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5846f51c2ca4fae54459ce9c50e3e820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77e0d4642a374a51f87e7e25b19281f</data>
