      <data key="d0">Care Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The **Care Team** is a multidisciplinary, collaborative group of healthcare providers, medical specialists, and clinical staff—including physicians, oncologists, surgeons, nurses, therapists, social workers, and allied health professionals—responsible for coordinating, managing, and delivering comprehensive patient care. 

