    <node id="Biomarker Testing">
      <data key="d0">Biomarker Testing</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">**Biomarker Testing** is a broad category of specialized diagnostic, molecular, and genomic laboratory tests and assays that evaluate the biological and genetic characteristics of tumors. Performed on biopsy specimens, surgically removed tumor tissues, or blood samples—often alongside imaging and standard histopathology—these tests include gene expression profiling, tumor sequencing, molecular profiling, and protein assays. 

Biomarker testing assesses a wide range of biological features, including DNA mutations, genetic alterations, gene fusions, expression profiles, and specific protein levels. Common markers evaluated include hormone receptors (estrogen and progesterone), HER2 status, p16 protein, PD-L1, microsatellite instability (MSI / MSI-H), mismatch repair deficiency (dMMR / MMR), and tumor mutational burden (TMB / TMB-H). 

Applied across various malignancies—such as breast cancer, ovarian cancer, bone cancer, and other solid tumors—biomarker</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3f05c8ea6f7c7b4ba1fb0ff1c1733980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0739b33959299ea67072f390ce38bffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb36cedd3f66584d65304e58b668eeab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea7b3f83164304ee4a562046eb0f5033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d0e32bdc49dbab9c2c953abf363e317&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4da30dee72e228147daa825e4f5be72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-562e1870b5e20f8648a2e56d960a1148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e4e845dfd1390f7f94cfb11bee1526&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d388da75afb5ea2d01c97e55cb2b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8333423c91919d7adde114b8286cca7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fb70c1c798caae12ac2d64e61bcbad4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06038ec84f20e873b9e275a23aea8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d383e4798456aa46e381fd2b02f6f96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ac570b4029abb181150e0d0975aefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a84075aaac61b0ad85e5f811fc4f24b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3ba7430f3a31330247f52afe7e9c68a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30c0bb66b1a2f93e89f5342ab1077451&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5846f51c2ca4fae54459ce9c50e3e820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-650982a589c2d527bc13923ccd0569ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77e0d4642a374a51f87e7e25b19281f</data>
