    <edge source="General Health Tests" target="Medical History">
      <data key="d4">40.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A comprehensive medical history is a core element of general health tests that helps clinicians select appropriate treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical history is a foundational component of general health testing conducted prior to cancer therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical history documentation is a core component of the general health test category.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical history is categorized as one of the primary general health tests described for patient evaluation.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical history is categorized as part of the general health assessments.</data>
      <data key="d6">clinical assessment, baseline evaluation&lt;SEP&gt;clinical intake, patient assessment&lt;SEP&gt;health assessment, clinical categorization&lt;SEP&gt;health assessment, patient records&lt;SEP&gt;health evaluation, clinical history</data>
