    <edge source="General Health Tests" target="Care Team">
      <data key="d4">15.0</data>
      <data key="d5">General health tests are conducted by the care team to evaluate patient readiness for treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The care team collects medical history and health assessments from general health tests to evaluate patient suitability for specific treatments.</data>
