    </edge>
    <edge source="Primary Care Physician" target="Care Team">
      <data key="d4">99.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Patients are advised to keep their primary care physician updated with contact and treatment information from their oncology care team.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients are encouraged to keep their primary care physician connected and updated with their oncology care team.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients are encouraged to keep their primary care physician updated with the contact details and decisions of their cancer care team.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients are instructed to coordinate between their oncology care team and primary care physician to maintain comprehensive care records.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients maintain an updated contact list and share medical changes from the care team with their primary care physician.&lt;SEP&gt;Primary care physicians maintain ongoing communication and shared medical records with the cancer care team.&lt;SEP&gt;The cancer care team coordinates treatment and exchanges patient updates with the primary care physician.&lt;SEP&gt;The care team collaborates with and receives updates from the primary care physician throughout cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;The patient and care team coordinate medical records and treatment updates with the primary care physician to ensure comprehensive patient care.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary care physician collaborates and shares treatment updates with the patient's wider cancer care team.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary care physician coordinates with and is kept updated by the care team during the course of a patient's cancer diagnosis and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary care physician coordinates with the oncology care team to maintain continuity of care.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary care physician is a key member of the patient's care team who must be kept informed of updates and changes.</data>
      <data key="d6">care coordination, clinical collaboration&lt;SEP&gt;care coordination, clinical communication&lt;SEP&gt;care coordination, medical communication&lt;SEP&gt;care coordination, medical records&lt;SEP&gt;clinical collaboration, patient care&lt;SEP&gt;collaborative healthcare, care coordination&lt;SEP&gt;medical collaboration, patient management</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-7606b44d6a30ad0519bc4c10785de79a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f36a4a5be80c8fa51631db16e52b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06038ec84f20e873b9e275a23aea8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a08bd0a819ea613e781d07188a350438&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38185832d6395b9952def9a72ecc339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa14ecd19e2d721cb99ea9590f0ede3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77e0d4642a374a51f87e7e25b19281f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82c7205fc2067a4d00e43fd22276db22</data>
    </edge>
