    <edge source="Radiologist" target="Imaging Tests">
      <data key="d4">81.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Radiologists analyze and interpret the images produced during imaging tests and compile diagnostic reports for doctors.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiologists analyze and interpret the results generated by diagnostic imaging tests.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiologists analyze imaging tests to detect primary tumors and cancer metastasis, generating diagnostic reports.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiologists are experts who interpret imaging tests and write diagnostic reports based on the findings.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiologists are responsible for interpreting results from imaging tests and generating clinical reports.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiologists are the medical experts tasked with interpreting imaging tests such as CT and MRI scans.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiologists are the medical specialists responsible for interpreting imaging tests and generating diagnostic reports.&lt;SEP&gt;The radiologist examines the imaging test outputs and writes a detailed clinical diagnostic report.&lt;SEP&gt;The radiologist is an expert responsible for reviewing and interpreting the results of imaging tests.</data>
      <data key="d6">diagnostic evaluation, medical reporting&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic imaging, clinical reporting&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic interpretation, medical reporting&lt;SEP&gt;medical diagnosis, report generation&lt;SEP&gt;medical imaging, diagnostic interpretation&lt;SEP&gt;medical interpretation, diagnostic reporting&lt;SEP&gt;medical interpretation, diagnostics</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dc281a303d0d4c5300c0c1c45b739ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db4e8318949a3fda5683c53985c6af05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa14ecd19e2d721cb99ea9590f0ede3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4724f6acaaa7931560b29614efc2927f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150</data>
    </edge>
