    <edge source="MRI Scan" target="Imaging Tests">
      <data key="d4">44.0</data>
      <data key="d5">An MRI scan is a non-radiation type of diagnostic imaging test.&lt;SEP&gt;An MRI scan is an imaging test utilizing magnetic fields to visualize internal structures for cancer staging.&lt;SEP&gt;MRI scans are a diagnostic modality within the broader category of medical imaging tests.&lt;SEP&gt;MRI scans are a specific imaging modality used to evaluate the prostate gland, pelvic bones, and adjacent lymph nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;MRI scans are a specific modality categorized under medical imaging tests.</data>
