    <edge source="MRI Scan" target="Technologist">
      <data key="d4">40.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Technologists operate the MRI scanner and must be informed by the patient about any metal inside the body before the scan.&lt;SEP&gt;Technologists operate the MRI scanner, check for metal implants, and guide patients through image acquisition.&lt;SEP&gt;The technologist operates the MRI machine and instructs the patient on breath-holding while collecting images.&lt;SEP&gt;The technologist operates the MRI scanner and instructs patients on safety and breath-holding during imaging.&lt;SEP&gt;The technologist operates the MRI scanner, screens for metal implants, and directs patient breathing during the scan.</data>
