      <data key="d5">An open MRI represents an open-sided configuration of MRI technology used for patient accessibility.&lt;SEP&gt;An open MRI represents an open-sided configuration of an MRI machine designed to avoid patient confinement.&lt;SEP&gt;Open MRI represents an alternative MRI design offering open ends for patient comfort.</data>
