    <edge source="Metastasis" target="Biopsy">
      <data key="d4">26.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A biopsy of metastatic sites may be required to confirm the spread of cancer to organs like lymph nodes or lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;Biopsies are conducted on metastatic sites such as lymph nodes or lungs to confirm the presence of spreading cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Biopsies of metastatic sites are conducted to verify cancer recurrence or distant spread.</data>
