    </edge>
    <edge source="Metastasis" target="Renal Cell Carcinoma">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Renal Cell Carcinoma can spread locally to nearby structures or undergo distant metastasis to other organs.</data>
      <data key="d6">disease progression, cancer spread</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-a08bd0a819ea613e781d07188a350438</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Metastasis" target="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Metastasis is the process defining advanced-stage prostate cancer as it spreads outside the prostate.&lt;SEP&gt;Metastasis is the process through which advanced-stage prostate cancer disseminates to bones, lymph nodes, or organs.</data>
      <data key="d6">disease progression, metastatic spread&lt;SEP&gt;pathology, cancer spread</data>
