    <edge source="Chronic Myeloid Leukemia" target="NCCN">
      <data key="d4">23.0</data>
      <data key="d5">NCCN provides patient guidelines to assist patients in understanding their care, diagnosis, and treatment for Chronic Myeloid Leukemia.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN publishes patient guidelines and expert recommendations to assist individuals diagnosed with cancers like chronic myeloid leukemia in making treatment decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN publishes patient guidelines and trusted treatment recommendations based on leading cancer center practices for managing CML.</data>
      <data key="d6">patient guidance, clinical recommendations&lt;SEP&gt;patient guidance, clinical resources&lt;SEP&gt;treatment guidelines, patient education</data>
