      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Blast Phase CML is an advanced and aggressive phase of Chronic Myeloid Leukemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Blast phase CML represents an advanced stage or form of chronic myeloid leukemia.</data>
      <data key="d6">disease progression, cancer subtype</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-8b66e38931f28ed6ac9b231faaf202fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5</data>
