      <data key="d5">A CML specialist provides expert medical evaluation, second opinions, and targeted treatment strategies for patients with CML.</data>
      <data key="d6">expert consultation, clinical management</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Chronic Myeloid Leukemia" target="Specialized CML Treatment Centers">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Centers experienced in CML provide optimal environments and specialized clinical experience for managing the leukemia.</data>
      <data key="d6">specialized treatment, cancer center</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Chronic Myeloid Leukemia" target="Blood Tests">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Blood tests are essential diagnostic procedures used to assess cell counts and formulate CML treatment plans.</data>
      <data key="d6">diagnostic testing, clinical assessment</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Chronic Myeloid Leukemia" target="Bone Marrow Tests">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Bone marrow tests evaluate blasts and genetic changes to diagnose CML and determine its phase.</data>
