    </edge>
    <edge source="Myeloid Progenitor Cells" target="Myeloblasts">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Myeloid progenitor cells differentiate into myeloblasts and other non-lymphoid blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Myeloid progenitor cells form myeloblasts during non-lymphoid cell maturation.</data>
      <data key="d6">cell maturation, differentiation&lt;SEP&gt;cellular differentiation, hematopoiesis</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-7606b44d6a30ad0519bc4c10785de79a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a99a89bec88823cedf4c1f0cd1a78e81</data>
    </edge>
