    </edge>
    <edge source="White Blood Cells" target="Lymphocytes">
      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Lymphocytes are a major category of white blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymphocytes constitute a major functional category of white blood cells within the immune system.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymphocytes represent a major category of white blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymphocytes represent a major subtype of white blood cells along with granulocytes and monocytes.</data>
