    <edge source="Red Blood Cells" target="Hematopoietic Stem Cells">
      <data key="d4">24.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Hematopoietic stem cells differentiate and mature into functioning red blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Hematopoietic stem cells differentiate through multi-stage processes to generate mature red blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Hematopoietic stem cells mature through intermediate stages to generate functional red blood cells.</data>
