    </edge>
    <edge source="Chemoradiation" target="Anal Cancer">
      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemoradiation is a primary therapeutic treatment option discussed for managing anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemoradiation is commonly used as an initial treatment approach for anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemoradiation is the standard curative treatment modality recommended for stages I, II, and III anal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemoradiation is the standard recommended treatment modality for non-metastatic anal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer therapy, treatment regimen&lt;SEP&gt;curative treatment, clinical protocol&lt;SEP&gt;treatment modality, cancer therapy&lt;SEP&gt;treatment protocol, oncology care</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-0d4cea71149e0e4157126efdaa0ea3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6236b93e627d54f73f1c8fe341127e67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06384634b72466c480713ee8d57f25ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-419f40f64b13b1b2d0fac3cfb9fde92a</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Chemoradiation" target="Non-Metastatic Anal Cancer">
