    <edge source="Breast Cancer" target="Invasive Breast Cancer">
      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Invasive breast cancer is a form of breast cancer where cancer cells invade surrounding tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;Invasive breast cancer is a major clinical categorization of breast malignancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Invasive breast cancer is a more advanced, spreading form of breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Invasive breast cancer represents a progression where breast cancer cells invade surrounding breast tissue.</data>
