    <edge source="Breast Cancer" target="Lobular Breast Cancer">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Lobular breast cancer is identified as one of the primary forms of breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Lobular cancer is one of the primary pathological subtypes of breast cancer that forms in the lobules.</data>
