      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">NCCN publishes patient guidelines and educational resources detailing the progression and management of breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN publishes patient guidelines and resources for managing different stages and types of breast cancer.</data>
