      <data key="d4">19.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Ductal carcinoma in situ (DCIS) is a specific localized form of breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Ductal carcinoma in situ is a specific noninvasive, stage 0 subtype of breast cancer.</data>
