      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Lobular carcinoma is identified as the second most common form of breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Lobular carcinoma is one of the most common types of breast cancer, arising in the breast lobules.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer subtype, prevalence&lt;SEP&gt;disease classification, cancer subtype</data>
