    </edge>
    <edge source="Breast Cancer" target="Biopsy">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Biopsies are utilized to extract tissue to confirm and analyze suspected breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Biopsy results are central to diagnosing breast cancer and developing an individualized treatment plan.</data>
