    <edge source="Breast Cancer" target="Inflammatory Breast Cancer (IBC)">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Inflammatory breast cancer is a distinct, aggressive subtype of breast cancer that blocks lymph vessels in the skin.</data>
