      <data key="d4">26.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Adenosquamous carcinoma is a mixed subtype of cervical cancer composed of both squamous and glandular cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Adenosquamous carcinoma is an identified subtype of cervical cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Adenosquamous carcinoma is classified as a common form of cervical cancer.</data>
