    <edge source="Prostate Cancer" target="Benign Prostatic Hyperplasia">
      <data key="d4">15.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Prostate cancer and benign prostatic hyperplasia share many identical urinary symptoms despite being distinct medical conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Prostate cancer and benign prostatic hyperplasia share many similar urinary symptoms, necessitating medical testing to distinguish between them.</data>
