    <edge source="Performance Status" target="Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group">
      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Performance status is evaluated using the scale established by the Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group to choose appropriate treatment options.&lt;SEP&gt;Performance status is formally measured using the rating scale developed by the Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group (ECOG).&lt;SEP&gt;The Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group created the ECOG score, a primary metric for determining patient performance status.&lt;SEP&gt;The Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group developed a widely used score to measure and assess patient performance status.</data>
      <data key="d6">clinical assessment, functional evaluation&lt;SEP&gt;clinical evaluation, scoring system&lt;SEP&gt;clinical evaluation, treatment planning&lt;SEP&gt;clinical measurement, oncology standard</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d73843c009e523101e1464a2b28bc144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa573748870dc50a98a935843997c68</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Performance Status" target="Karnofsky Performance Status">
      <data key="d4">27.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Karnofsky Performance Status is one of the standard scales used to quantify performance status.&lt;SEP&gt;Performance status is measured using the Karnofsky Performance Status scoring scale.&lt;SEP&gt;The Karnofsky Performance Status is a standard clinical rating scale used to assess overall performance status.</data>
      <data key="d6">functional assessment, scoring scale&lt;SEP&gt;functional scoring, clinical assessment&lt;SEP&gt;measurement scale, clinical scoring</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-3fbf2f6a3c150687a59f814d94f1d150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d73843c009e523101e1464a2b28bc144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa573748870dc50a98a935843997c68</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Performance Status" target="Care Team">
      <data key="d4">40.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The care team evaluates a patient's performance status to gauge their ability to undergo treatment and determine clinical trial eligibility.&lt;SEP&gt;The care team evaluates a patient's performance status to gauge treatment tolerance and clinical trial readiness.&lt;SEP&gt;The care team evaluates performance status to determine how well a patient can tolerate proposed therapies.&lt;SEP&gt;The care team evaluates the patient's performance status using standard scales to guide therapy decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;The care team evaluates the patient's performance status when formulating a personalized treatment plan.</data>
      <data key="d6">clinical evaluation, patient assessment&lt;SEP&gt;clinical evaluation, readiness assessment&lt;SEP&gt;functional assessment, clinical decision-making&lt;SEP&gt;patient evaluation, treatment decision</data>
