    <edge source="Hodgkin Lymphoma" target="Lymphatic System">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Hodgkin lymphoma is a cancer that originates in and affects the tissues and cells of the lymphatic system.&lt;SEP&gt;Hodgkin lymphoma typically originates in the lymph nodes of the upper body within the lymphatic system.</data>
