    <edge source="Lymphocytes" target="Natural Killer Cells">
      <data key="d4">34.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Natural killer cells are a major class of lymphocytes.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural killer cells are a specific category of lymphocytes that target tumor cells and infections.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural killer cells are one of the three major classes of lymphocytes within the immune system.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural killer cells are one of the three principal types of lymphocytes alongside B cells and T cells.</data>
