    </edge>
    <edge source="Lymphatic System" target="Lymph Nodes">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Lymph nodes are core components of the lymphatic system situated across the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Lymph nodes are integral filter structures situated along the pathways of the lymphatic system.</data>
      <data key="d6">anatomical component, biological structure&lt;SEP&gt;anatomical structure, immune function</data>
