    <edge source="MyChart" target="Care Team">
      <data key="d4">24.0</data>
      <data key="d5">MyChart serves as a digital portal allowing patients to access test records and message their care team.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients use MyChart to send messages and coordinate with their care team.&lt;SEP&gt;The Care Team utilizes MyChart and electronic portals to deliver visit notes, share test results, and communicate with patients.</data>
