    <edge source="Diffuse Large B-Cell Lymphoma" target="Follicular Lymphoma">
      <data key="d4">15.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Certain high-grade follicular lymphomas, such as FL grade 3B, are treated as diffuse large B-cell lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Follicular lymphoma grades, such as grade 3A, may be managed similarly to diffuse large B-cell lymphoma depending on cellular composition and clinical protocols.</data>
