      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Follicular lymphoma grade 3A may be treated as diffuse large B-cell lymphoma depending on cellular diagnostic results.&lt;SEP&gt;Follicular lymphoma grade 3A may be treated similarly to diffuse large B-cell lymphoma depending on cellular features.</data>
      <data key="d6">treatment protocol, clinical management&lt;SEP&gt;treatment regimen, clinical management</data>
