      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Intrahepatic bile duct cancer is a specific anatomical form of bile duct cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Intrahepatic bile duct cancer is an anatomical subtype of bile duct cancer situated within the liver.</data>
