    <edge source="Head and Neck Cancer" target="Mouth Cancer">
      <data key="d4">26.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Mouth cancer is a primary subtype within the group of head and neck cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouth cancer is a specific manifestation within the broader spectrum of head and neck cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouth cancer is categorized as a type of head and neck cancer.</data>
