    <edge source="Head and Neck Cancer" target="Dental Exam">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Dental evaluations and procedures are recommended prior to head and neck cancer treatment to manage potential complications to the teeth and jaw.&lt;SEP&gt;Treatments for head and neck cancer can damage the jaw, teeth, and gums, requiring dental examinations and procedures prior to starting therapy.</data>
      <data key="d6">pre-treatment care, oral health&lt;SEP&gt;pretreatment assessment, oral health</data>
