    </edge>
    <edge source="Head and Neck Cancer" target="Endocrine Tests">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Endocrine blood tests assess thyroid and pituitary function that may be compromised by radiation treatment for head and neck cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation therapy for head and neck cancer can damage endocrine glands like the thyroid, necessitating pretreatment and posttreatment endocrine blood tests.</data>
      <data key="d6">radiation impact, endocrine monitoring&lt;SEP&gt;radiation impact, hormonal monitoring</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Head and Neck Cancer" target="Hearing Test">
      <data key="d4">25.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Both tumors and treatments associated with head and neck cancer can impair hearing, making hearing tests essential.&lt;SEP&gt;Hearing tests evaluate potential auditory deficits caused by head and neck tumors or therapies that damage hearing.&lt;SEP&gt;Hearing tests monitor changes in hearing caused by head and neck tumors or their treatments.</data>
      <data key="d6">audiological monitoring, treatment side effects&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic testing, auditory complications&lt;SEP&gt;hearing loss, side effect monitoring</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33608457001e818e2b300adae9c6c0d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Head and Neck Cancer" target="Nutrition Assessment">
      <data key="d4">14.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A nutrition assessment ensures patients maintain adequate nutritional intake before starting head and neck cancer therapies.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients undergoing treatment for head and neck cancer require nutritional evaluation to ensure adequate nourishment during therapy.</data>
      <data key="d6">nutritional support, pretreatment planning&lt;SEP&gt;supportive care, nutrition management</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Head and Neck Cancer" target="Speech and Swallowing Assessment">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Head and neck cancer and its therapies can affect speaking and swallowing functions, requiring assessments before and after treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Speech and swallowing functions are tested before and after head and neck cancer treatments to address treatment-related impairments.</data>
      <data key="d6">functional assessment, rehabilitation&lt;SEP&gt;functional therapy, rehabilitation</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-052101b592e186cce702983d2acc67e4</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Head and Neck Cancer" target="Fertility Preservation">
      <data key="d4">15.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Cancer treatments can impair reproductive function, requiring discussion of fertility preservation before starting therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer treatments such as chemotherapy can compromise reproductive health, making fertility preservation an essential discussion prior to treatment.</data>
      <data key="d6">reproductive health, treatment implications&lt;SEP&gt;reproductive health, treatment side effects</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33608457001e818e2b300adae9c6c0d9</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Head and Neck Cancer" target="Biopsy">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Biopsy procedures are utilized to examine tissue samples from tumors and lymph nodes to determine the histology and treatment plan for head and neck cancer.</data>
