    <edge source="Fertility Preservation" target="NCCN">
      <data key="d4">86.0</data>
      <data key="d5">NCCN offers guidance and patient educational materials regarding fertility preservation during cancer therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN provides patient guidelines and resources addressing family planning and fertility preservation for cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN provides patient guidelines covering fertility and family planning considerations for adolescent and young adult cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN provides patient guidelines detailing fertility preservation options and resources for cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN publishes guidelines and resources informing cancer patients about options for fertility preservation before treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN publishes guidelines dedicated to educating adolescent and young adult cancer patients on fertility and family planning options.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN publishes patient guidelines and app-based information covering fertility preservation options for cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;The NCCN provides clinical guidelines for young cancer patients addressing fertility preservation and reproductive health.&lt;SEP&gt;The NCCN provides guidance and patient resources regarding fertility preservation options in young cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;The NCCN provides patient guidelines and mobile resources concerning fertility preservation options for cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;The NCCN publishes patient guides and resources detailing fertility preservation recommendations for cancer patients.</data>
