    <edge source="Fertility Preservation" target="Fertility Specialist">
      <data key="d4">46.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A fertility specialist helps patients explore and implement reproductive options as part of fertility preservation before treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertility specialists advise and guide patients on options and methods for preserving fertility before undergoing cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertility specialists advise cancer patients on options and protocols to preserve fertility prior to initiating therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertility specialists advise patients on available options and techniques for fertility preservation prior to starting oncologic therapies.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertility specialists guide and consult patients on available options to preserve their fertility before therapy.</data>
