    </edge>
    <edge source="Fertility Preservation" target="Sperm Banking">
      <data key="d4">27.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Sperm banking is a primary fertility preservation option available to male patients before undergoing gonadotoxic cancer therapies.&lt;SEP&gt;Sperm banking is a specific fertility preservation method recommended before cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Sperm banking is an established clinical option for male fertility preservation prior to undergoing cancer therapy.</data>
      <data key="d6">fertility option, cryopreservation&lt;SEP&gt;fertility preservation, reproductive health&lt;SEP&gt;reproductive preservation, clinical procedure</data>
