    </edge>
    <edge source="Fertility Preservation" target="Egg Freezing">
      <data key="d4">27.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Egg freezing is a recognized method of preserving female reproductive capacity before starting gonadotoxic treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Egg freezing is an established fertility preservation method utilized prior to cytotoxic cancer therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Egg freezing represents an established fertility preservation technique for female patients before starting cancer treatments.</data>
      <data key="d6">cryopreservation, reproductive health&lt;SEP&gt;fertility preservation, reproductive health&lt;SEP&gt;reproductive preservation, clinical procedure</data>
