    </edge>
    <edge source="Fertility Preservation" target="Ovarian Tissue Banking">
      <data key="d4">26.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Ovarian tissue banking is an advanced fertility preservation option for patients undergoing cancer therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Ovarian tissue banking is an advanced method used to preserve female reproductive tissue prior to cancer interventions.&lt;SEP&gt;Ovarian tissue cryopreservation is an advanced surgical option for female fertility preservation.</data>
      <data key="d6">fertility preservation, reproductive health&lt;SEP&gt;reproductive preservation, tissue cryopreservation&lt;SEP&gt;tissue banking, fertility option</data>
