    <edge source="Bone Marrow Aspirate And Biopsy" target="AML">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Bone marrow aspirate and biopsy are essential tests for confirming an AML diagnosis by measuring the percentage of myeloid blasts.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone marrow aspirate and biopsy is a key diagnostic test to identify AML biomarkers and genetic mutations.</data>
