    <edge source="Complete Blood Count" target="AML">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A complete blood count and differential are essential blood tests used to evaluate cell counts and identify abnormal blast cells in AML.&lt;SEP&gt;Complete blood count is a fundamental test used to detect low healthy blood cell counts and abnormal white blood cells associated with AML.</data>
