    <edge source="Complete Blood Count" target="Blood Tests">
      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A complete blood count is a fundamental laboratory test included under diagnostic blood work.&lt;SEP&gt;A complete blood count is a specific type of blood test measuring cell counts.&lt;SEP&gt;A complete blood count is one of the specific blood tests ordered during the initial workup.&lt;SEP&gt;Complete blood count is a primary type of blood test conducted to examine blood cellular components.</data>
