    <edge source="AML" target="Heart Tests">
      <data key="d4">14.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Heart tests are indicated for AML patients to ensure cardiovascular readiness for therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Heart tests are standard diagnostic procedures listed in the AML testing guide to assess patient tolerance.</data>
