    <edge source="Direct Laryngoscopy" target="Doctor">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A doctor conducts direct laryngoscopy to examine the deeper throat and obtain tissue specimens under general anesthesia.&lt;SEP&gt;Doctors perform direct laryngoscopy to examine the throat, determine if a tumor is resectable, and take tissue biopsies.</data>
