    <edge source="Bladder Cancer" target="Radical Cystectomy">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Radical cystectomy is the most widely used surgical procedure for treating muscle-invasive bladder cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Radical cystectomy is the primary surgical treatment modality for muscle-invasive bladder cancer.</data>
