    </edge>
    <edge source="Methotrexate" target="Primary CNS Lymphoma">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Methotrexate serves as the primary and most effective chemotherapy agent used to treat primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
