    <edge source="Pancreatic Cancer" target="Endoscopic Tests">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Endoscopic tests are deployed as part of the comprehensive diagnostic series to evaluate pancreatic tumors.&lt;SEP&gt;Endoscopic tests are diagnostic procedures used to examine and identify pancreatic cancer.</data>
