    </edge>
    <edge source="Benign Prostatic Hyperplasia" target="Erectile Dysfunction">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Erectile dysfunction is among the pelvic and urinary symptoms shared between benign prostatic hyperplasia and prostate cancer.</data>
