      <data key="d7">chunk-aeafa486bfd320cdaa7811ad75777912</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Early-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="BRCA2 Mutation">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Carrying an inherited BRCA2 gene mutation increases the risk of developing prostate cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">genetic predisposition, risk factor</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Early-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="NCCN">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The NCCN publishes patient guidelines and educational applications specifically for early-stage prostate cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">patient resources, medical guidelines</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Early-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Family History Of Cancer">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Having a family history of prostate or related cancers increases an individual's likelihood of developing prostate cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">risk factor, disease predisposition</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Metastatic Prostate Cancer">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Metastatic prostate cancer is a form of advanced-stage prostate cancer that has spread to distant organs and bones.&lt;SEP&gt;Metastatic prostate cancer, in which cancer cells spread to distant sites like bones and other organs, is a major form of advanced-stage prostate cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">metastasis, clinical progression&lt;SEP&gt;subtype, disease classification</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-c6d28b36fe82792dfb86e98ef76b3b04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Regional Prostate Cancer">
      <data key="d4">26.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Regional prostate cancer is a form of advanced-stage prostate cancer where cancer has spread to nearby lymph nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;Regional prostate cancer is a manifestation of advanced-stage disease where cancer has spread into the pelvic region.&lt;SEP&gt;Regional prostate cancer, where cancer spreads only to nearby lymph nodes, is considered a form of advanced-stage prostate cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">disease classification, localized spread&lt;SEP&gt;disease staging, anatomical extension&lt;SEP&gt;subtype, disease classification</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-c6d28b36fe82792dfb86e98ef76b3b04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6232dd9ed168a1113955e7300645338b</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemotherapy is an indicated treatment method for patients managing advanced-stage prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is used in advanced-stage prostate cancer to reduce symptoms, slow growth, and extend survival.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer therapy, treatment regimen&lt;SEP&gt;palliative treatment, disease management</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6232dd9ed168a1113955e7300645338b</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Hormone Therapy">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Hormone therapy is a key treatment strategy used to manage advanced-stage prostate cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Hormone therapy is one of the principal treatment modalities used to prolong life and slow disease progression in advanced-stage prostate cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer therapy, disease management&lt;SEP&gt;systemic treatment, cancer care</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6232dd9ed168a1113955e7300645338b</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Radiation Therapy">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Radiation therapy is employed to help control advanced-stage prostate cancer and reduce symptoms.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation therapy is employed to treat advanced-stage prostate cancer and manage associated symptoms.</data>
      <data key="d6">radiation oncology, cancer management&lt;SEP&gt;treatment option, symptom management</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6232dd9ed168a1113955e7300645338b</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Black Males">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Black males are more likely to be diagnosed with aggressive and advanced-stage prostate cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">clinical risk, disease severity</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Health Care Providers">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Health care teams work collaboratively with patients to evaluate therapy options and determine the optimal treatment strategy for advanced prostate cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">treatment planning, patient care</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Diet And Lifestyle">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Dietary habits, smoking, obesity, and exercise significantly influence the risk of developing advanced-stage prostate cancer and dying from it.</data>
      <data key="d6">lifestyle risk, disease progression</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Immunotherapy">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Immunotherapy is an available therapeutic option used to fight advanced-stage prostate cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer immunotherapy, disease treatment</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Targeted Therapy">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Targeted therapy is applied in advanced-stage prostate cancer to focus on specific tumor characteristics.</data>
      <data key="d6">precision medicine, cancer therapy</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Radiopharmaceuticals">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Radiopharmaceuticals provide targeted radioactive treatment for patients with advanced-stage prostate cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">radiotherapy, disease treatment</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Surgery">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Surgical intervention is among the recognized therapeutic procedures for managing prostate cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">surgical treatment, clinical intervention</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-aa251c48fc1fccfe45605a384f743662</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer" target="Tumor Staging">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Tumor staging tests determine the extent of disease progression and whether cancer is in an advanced stage.</data>
