    <edge source="Digital Rectal Exam" target="Doctor">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A doctor conducts the digital rectal exam by inserting a gloved finger into the rectum to check the prostate.&lt;SEP&gt;The doctor performs the digital rectal exam using a gloved finger to evaluate the size and texture of the prostate gland.</data>
