    </edge>
    <edge source="Corticosteroids" target="Primary CNS Lymphoma">
      <data key="d4">24.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Corticosteroids are administered short-term to primary CNS lymphoma patients to reduce swelling and tumor burden.&lt;SEP&gt;Corticosteroids are identified as one of the specific treatment options used to manage and treat primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Corticosteroids are used as a medical treatment option to manage primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
      <data key="d6">medical treatment, pharmacotherapy&lt;SEP&gt;pharmacotherapy, treatment option&lt;SEP&gt;symptom management, medical treatment</data>
