    </edge>
    <edge source="Corticosteroids" target="Biopsy">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A biopsy must be performed before starting corticosteroids because steroids can alter lymphoma cells and hinder pathology diagnosis.</data>
      <data key="d6">clinical sequencing, diagnostic impact</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Genetic Cancer Risk Testing" target="Diagnostic Testing for MBC">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Genetic cancer risk testing forms part of the diagnostic testing protocol to identify hereditary factors in breast cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">hereditary genetics, risk assessment</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5</data>
    </edge>
