    </edge>
    <edge source="Diagnostic Testing for MBC" target="Imaging Tests">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Imaging tests are essential modalities within metastatic breast cancer diagnostic testing used to visualize distant tumors.</data>
      <data key="d6">diagnostic imaging, cancer staging</data>
