      <data key="d7">chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="Eye Exam">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A complete eye exam is recommended for everyone diagnosed with primary CNS lymphoma to rule out or identify vitreoretinal involvement.&lt;SEP&gt;Eye exams are required during diagnostic evaluation to determine whether primary CNS lymphoma has spread to or originated in the eyes.</data>
      <data key="d6">diagnostic evaluation, ocular staging&lt;SEP&gt;ophthalmic evaluation, staging</data>
