    </edge>
    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="Blood Tests">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Blood tests are conducted as part of the standard diagnostic battery for patients suspected of having primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
