      <data key="d7">chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="Impaired Immune System">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">An impaired immune system is identified as a significant risk factor increasing the probability of developing primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
      <data key="d6">risk factor, immunosuppression</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="Remission">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Therapeutic regimens aim to place primary CNS lymphoma into remission, relieving all detectable signs of cancer.</data>
