      <data key="d7">chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="Relapse">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Primary CNS lymphoma can return after earlier treatment, necessitating more intensive therapeutic strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Primary CNS lymphoma frequently recurs or relapses in the brain, spinal cord, or eye even after achieving remission.</data>
      <data key="d6">disease progression, treatment failure&lt;SEP&gt;disease recurrence, prognosis</data>
