    </edge>
    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="Specialized Treatment Center">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Patients diagnosed with primary CNS lymphoma are strongly advised to seek care at centers experienced in treating brain lymphomas.</data>
      <data key="d6">specialized care, hospital referral</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="Magnetic Resonance Imaging">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Magnetic Resonance Imaging is the most useful imaging method for detecting, sizing, and monitoring primary CNS lymphoma tumors.</data>
