    </edge>
    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="Stereotactic Biopsy">
      <data key="d4">28.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Stereotactic biopsy is the primary procedure required to extract brain tumor tissue and definitively diagnose primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Stereotactic biopsy is the standard diagnostic procedure used to confirm primary CNS lymphoma in brain tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;Stereotactic biopsy is the standard procedure required to confirm a definitive diagnosis of primary CNS lymphoma by extracting tumor tissue.</data>
