    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="NCCN">
      <data key="d4">25.0</data>
      <data key="d5">NCCN experts provide treatment guidance and recommendations specifically for patients diagnosed with primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN provides clinical expertise and treatment guidelines for managing primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN publishes patient guidelines and resources detailing the diagnosis, staging, and management of primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
