    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="Immunotherapy">
      <data key="d4">24.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Immunotherapy engages the patient's immune system to attack primary CNS lymphoma cells throughout the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Immunotherapy is an essential treatment modality utilized in combating primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Immunotherapy is an established treatment option for treating primary CNS lymphoma.</data>
