    </edge>
    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="Stem Cell Rescue">
      <data key="d4">24.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Stem cell rescue following high-dose chemotherapy is one of the intensive treatment options considered for primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Stem cell rescue is a specialized treatment approach utilized alongside chemotherapy for primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Stem cell rescue is an aggressive procedure considered for patients with primary CNS lymphoma, especially after relapse or prior treatments.</data>
