    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="Targeted Therapy">
      <data key="d4">24.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Targeted therapy is among the specialized cancer treatment options available for patients with primary CNS lymphoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Targeted therapy is applied as a treatment option for primary CNS lymphoma to selectively attack parts of cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Targeted therapy is utilized to treat primary CNS lymphoma, often in combination with chemotherapy.</data>
