    </edge>
    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="Surgery">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Surgery is generally avoided for primary CNS lymphoma because deep brain tumors carry high risks of harm rather than benefit.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgery is typically not an option for primary CNS lymphoma due to risks associated with deep brain tissue involvement.</data>
