    </edge>
    <edge source="Bone Cancer" target="Giant Cell Tumor of Bone">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Giant cell tumor of bone (GCTB) is addressed alongside bone cancers as a bone lesion requiring aggressive treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Giant cell tumor of bone is identified as a specific type of bone tumor originating in the metaphysis.</data>
      <data key="d6">bone disease, clinical diagnosis&lt;SEP&gt;tumor classification, pathology</data>
