    </edge>
    <edge source="Bone Cancer" target="NCCN">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">NCCN provides patient guidelines and resources to help patients understand diagnosis, treatment choices, and care for bone cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;NCCN publishes patient guidelines and educational materials specifically for bone cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">patient education, clinical guidelines&lt;SEP&gt;patient education, clinical guidelines, cancer care</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bone Cancer" target="Chondrosarcoma">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chondrosarcoma is a specific subtype of bone cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Chondrosarcoma is classified and discussed as a specific type of bone cancer.</data>
      <data key="d6">disease classification, cancer subtype&lt;SEP&gt;disease taxonomy, oncology classification</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-6b02315423350f3598288e189fbcb8ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bone Cancer" target="Ewing Sarcoma">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
