    <edge source="Glioma" target="Astrocytoma">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Astrocytoma is a specific histological type of glioma whose cells resemble astrocytes.&lt;SEP&gt;Astrocytoma is one of the three most common subtypes of glioma tumors.</data>
      <data key="d6">classification, disease subtype&lt;SEP&gt;subtype classification, oncology</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-ffc3446f8ec092af24a460bda94f772f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Glioma" target="Oligodendroglioma">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Oligodendroglioma is a histological type of glioma whose cells resemble oligodendrocytes.&lt;SEP&gt;Oligodendroglioma is one of the three most common subtypes of glioma tumors.</data>
      <data key="d6">classification, disease subtype&lt;SEP&gt;subtype classification, oncology</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-ffc3446f8ec092af24a460bda94f772f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1</data>
