    <edge source="Glioma" target="Glial Cells">
      <data key="d4">28.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Gliomas are brain tumors that originate from or resemble glial cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Gliomas originate directly from abnormal glial cells within the central nervous system.&lt;SEP&gt;Gliomas originate from glial cells that undergo mutations and multiply uncontrollably.</data>
      <data key="d6">cellular origin, biological classification&lt;SEP&gt;cellular origin, oncogenesis&lt;SEP&gt;cellular origin, tumor pathology</data>
