    <edge source="Biopsy" target="Care Team">
      <data key="d4">25.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The care team recommends and schedules a biopsy when diagnostic imaging indicates the presence of a glioma.&lt;SEP&gt;The care team uses biopsy findings and pathology reports to formulate the patient's cancer treatment plan.&lt;SEP&gt;The care team utilizes biopsy findings to determine patient diagnosis and treatment trajectories.</data>
