    </edge>
    <edge source="Biopsy" target="CT Scan">
      <data key="d4">30.0</data>
      <data key="d5">CT scans are employed to guide needle placement during biopsies of abnormal lymph nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;CT scans are imaging tools used to visualize masses and guide needle placement during biopsies.&lt;SEP&gt;CT scans can be used to provide precise visual guidance during tissue biopsies.&lt;SEP&gt;CT scans can be utilized to guide needle placement during lymph node and tissue biopsies.</data>
