    <edge source="Biopsy" target="Biomarker Testing">
      <data key="d4">34.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Biomarker tests are performed on biopsy specimens to inform targeted therapeutic planning.&lt;SEP&gt;Biopsy tissue samples can undergo biomarker testing to detect DNA mutations and specific proteins.&lt;SEP&gt;Tissue samples collected during a biopsy undergo biomarker testing for molecular and genomic analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Tissue samples obtained from a biopsy are subjected to biomarker testing to determine hormone receptor and HER2 status.</data>
