    </edge>
    <edge source="Biopsy" target="Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d4">23.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A biopsy is performed to obtain a tumor sample for testing when chemotherapy is planned prior to surgical removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Biopsy samples may be retrieved to confirm diagnosis prior to beginning chemotherapy if cancer is too extensive for initial surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;If chemotherapy is recommended prior to surgery, a biopsy is performed first.</data>
