    <edge source="Care Team" target="Physical Exam">
      <data key="d4">32.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The care team conducts physical exams to review lymph nodes and general patient health prior to treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;The care team or health care provider directly conducts the physical exam, measuring vital signs and examining body organs.&lt;SEP&gt;The care team performs physical exams to evaluate organ health, vital signs, and lymph nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;The physical exam is conducted by healthcare providers on the care team to check general health and examine the head and neck.</data>
